    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/cdaa8559e22f945428f7b0d871fe6aa9.poster.avif?t=1753537828\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/cdaa8559e22f945428f7b0d871fe6aa9.webm?t=1753537828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/cdaa8559e22f945428f7b0d871fe6aa9.mp4?t=1753537828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alpha Nomos is a rhythm based action rougelite that blends musical based mechanics with fast-paced hack and slash action. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Cello and her gang escape a twisted world full of crazed puppets and a strange magical force called music. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/48b4085061e150b81ae4d2da0f477dd4.avif?t=1753537828\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/8ebccc8e88ffdae86a302fdd692f9088.poster.avif?t=1753537828\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/8ebccc8e88ffdae86a302fdd692f9088.webm?t=1753537828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/8ebccc8e88ffdae86a302fdd692f9088.mp4?t=1753537828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use musical instruments to strike down your stuffed opposition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You hit harder when your attacks land on beat, feel the groove and play epic solos while dealing massive damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/37caf80062bfca91f96affd701f0db96.avif?t=1753537828\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/f89ff66165e10789bff9b715b4f13a99.poster.avif?t=1753537828\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/f89ff66165e10789bff9b715b4f13a99.webm?t=1753537828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/f89ff66165e10789bff9b715b4f13a99.mp4?t=1753537828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft unique builds of musical powerups which effect how your weapons sound!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolving musical effects change the way you play making every run a unique performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/59a7bf2d9b99de867636d308a3980696.avif?t=1753537828\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/ea56f309859b108d9f893b8ebf541aed.poster.avif?t=1753537828\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/ea56f309859b108d9f893b8ebf541aed.webm?t=1753537828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/ea56f309859b108d9f893b8ebf541aed.mp4?t=1753537828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a music-reactive world twisted in time and space by the power of the Alpha Nomos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment to get into the rhythm!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/cdaa8559e22f945428f7b0d871fe6aa9.poster.avif?t=1753537828\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/cdaa8559e22f945428f7b0d871fe6aa9.webm?t=1753537828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/cdaa8559e22f945428f7b0d871fe6aa9.mp4?t=1753537828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alpha Nomos is a rhythm based action rougelite that blends musical based mechanics with fast-paced hack and slash action. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Cello and her gang escape a twisted world full of crazed puppets and a strange magical force called music. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/48b4085061e150b81ae4d2da0f477dd4.avif?t=1753537828\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/8ebccc8e88ffdae86a302fdd692f9088.poster.avif?t=1753537828\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/8ebccc8e88ffdae86a302fdd692f9088.webm?t=1753537828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/8ebccc8e88ffdae86a302fdd692f9088.mp4?t=1753537828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use musical instruments to strike down your stuffed opposition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You hit harder when your attacks land on beat, feel the groove and play epic solos while dealing massive damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/37caf80062bfca91f96affd701f0db96.avif?t=1753537828\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/f89ff66165e10789bff9b715b4f13a99.poster.avif?t=1753537828\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/f89ff66165e10789bff9b715b4f13a99.webm?t=1753537828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/f89ff66165e10789bff9b715b4f13a99.mp4?t=1753537828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft unique builds of musical powerups which effect how your weapons sound!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolving musical effects change the way you play making every run a unique performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/59a7bf2d9b99de867636d308a3980696.avif?t=1753537828\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/ea56f309859b108d9f893b8ebf541aed.poster.avif?t=1753537828\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/ea56f309859b108d9f893b8ebf541aed.webm?t=1753537828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/ea56f309859b108d9f893b8ebf541aed.mp4?t=1753537828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a music-reactive world twisted in time and space by the power of the Alpha Nomos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment to get into the rhythm!</p>",
